---
// Usluge — horizontalni pinned scroll (desktop) / swipe (mobilno)
---

<section class="section services-wrap" id="usluge">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head" data-reveal>
      <div>
        <span class="eyebrow">Usluge</span>
        <h2 class="section-title">Šta <span class="accent">radimo</span></h2>
      </div>
      <p class="section-subtitle">Četiri discipline, jedna misija — digitalna rješenja koja pokreću vaše poslovanje naprijed.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="services-h" id="services-h">
    <div class="services-sticky" id="services-sticky">
      <div class="services-track" id="services-track">

        <article class="service-card">
          <div class="card-glow" aria-hidden="true"></div>
          <span class="num">01</span>
          <div class="icon">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8">
              <rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="3" />
              <path d="M3 9h18M9 21V9" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3>ERP rješenja</h3>
          <p>Kompletna integracija poslovnih procesa i optimizacija proizvodnje u realnom vremenu.</p>
          <ul class="features">
            <li>Upravljanje resursima i zalihama</li>
            <li>Praćenje proizvodnje u realnom vremenu</li>
            <li>Izvještaji i poslovna analitika</li>
            <li>Prilagođeni moduli po potrebi</li>
          </ul>
          <div class="tags">
            <span class="tag">Integracije</span>
            <span class="tag">Analitika</span>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="service-card">
          <div class="card-glow" aria-hidden="true"></div>
          <span class="num">02</span>
          <div class="icon">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8">
              <path d="M4 17V7l8-4 8 4v10l-8 4-8-4z" />
              <path d="M4 7l8 4 8-4M12 11v10" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3>MES rješenja</h3>
          <p>Praćenje proizvodnje od naloga do gotovog proizvoda, sa podacima direktno sa mašina.</p>
          <ul class="features">
            <li>Nalozi i tok proizvodnje</li>
            <li>Prikupljanje podataka sa mašina</li>
            <li>Sljedivost materijala i serija</li>
            <li>Kontrola kvaliteta i otpada</li>
          </ul>
          <div class="tags">
            <span class="tag">Industrija 4.0</span>
            <span class="tag">Sljedivost</span>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="service-card">
          <div class="card-glow" aria-hidden="true"></div>
          <span class="num">03</span>
          <div class="icon">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8">
              <rect x="2" y="4" width="20" height="13" rx="2" />
              <path d="M8 21h8M12 17v4" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3>Web & App Development</h3>
          <p>Moderne web stranice i mobilne aplikacije koje donose rezultate i zadovoljne korisnike.</p>
          <ul class="features">
            <li>Web stranice i e-commerce</li>
            <li>Mobilne aplikacije (iOS & Android)</li>
            <li>REST API i backend integracije</li>
            <li>Cloud hosting i deployment</li>
          </ul>
          <div class="tags">
            <span class="tag">React</span>
            <span class="tag">.NET</span>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="service-card">
          <div class="card-glow" aria-hidden="true"></div>
          <span class="num">04</span>
          <div class="icon">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8">
              <path d="M22 3H2v6h20V3zM22 11H2v6h20v-6zM12 21v-4" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3>Digitalni marketing</h3>
          <p>Strategije koje grade vaš brend i donose mjerljive rezultate na digitalnim kanalima.</p>
          <ul class="features">
            <li>Strategija društvenih mreža</li>
            <li>SEO i content marketing</li>
            <li>Google & Meta oglašavanje</li>
            <li>Analitika i mjesečni izvještaji</li>
          </ul>
          <div class="tags">
            <span class="tag">SEO</span>
            <span class="tag">Ads</span>
          </div>
        </article>

      </div>

      <div class="services-progress" aria-hidden="true"><div class="bar" id="services-progress-bar"></div></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
